  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組，用心製作。大量活躍模組支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>隱藏合成配方書是一個簡單的客戶端模組，可以切換所有合成介面中配方按鈕的顯示與否。伺服器端並不需要安裝此模組。包含一些設定選項，可控制何時發送訊息及關閉功能。同時也適用於熔爐介面。<br><br>具有一個快捷鍵（預設為 Tab 鍵），可切換配方按鈕的顯示狀態。在開啟合成格時按下即可生效。雖然與玩家列表使用相同的快捷鍵，但它們彼此不會干擾。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>shouldHideRecipeBook</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>是否在客戶端首次啟動時預設隱藏配方書。<br><br><span><strong>allowRecipeBookToggleHotkey</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>是否允許使用快捷鍵切換配方書顯示狀態。<br><br><span><strong>showMessageOnRecipeBookToggle</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false<br>切換配方書顯示/隱藏時是否發送訊息。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>功能說明：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hidden-recipe-book/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>快捷鍵（預設為 Tab 鍵）：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hidden-recipe-book/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"909\" height=\"508\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>按下快捷鍵後：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hidden-recipe-book/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"524\" height=\"496\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載檔案仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，你可以自由在任何模組包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若遇到問題、有想法、建議或任何其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝您！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
